+| S14 | `semantic.k:40` | `Index ::= Expr \| Slice` | Submitted program uses literal `0` and one slice. |
+| S15 | `semantic.k:41` | `Slice(Bound,Bound,Bound)` | Submitted program uses `[1:]`. |
